## Aspire's own agent skills, installed by `aspire agent init`. Not committed:
## they ship with the Aspire CLI and are version matched to whichever one you
## have, so a vendored copy drifts the moment anybody updates. AGENTS.md lists
## the command as a setup step.
.claude/skills/

## Per-machine agent settings. .claude/settings.json is shared; this one holds
## whatever must not be.
.claude/settings.local.json
